# The shield prevents the first hit from a red double striker, then the second hit is dealt (CR 615.8).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Greater Realm of Preservation
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Twinscroll Shaman
Mountain x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Greater Realm of Preservation.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Twinscroll Shaman.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Twinscroll Shaman > Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Greater Realm of Preservation.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Greater Realm of Preservation)
Bot1.Choose(Bot2.Battlefield.Twinscroll Shaman)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Prevented = 1 Twinscroll Shaman > Bot1 by Greater Realm of Preservation
